        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 300_000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.035\n    loan_term_years = 30\n\n    # Calculate the monthly payment for the first year\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    total_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n    monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** -total_payments)\n    )\n\n    # Return the payment rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(monthly_payment)\n```",
